  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2803.03 Fugitive Emission Control Systems for Non-Metallic Mineral Processing Plants",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2803.03 Fugitive Emission Control Systems for Non-Metallic Mineral Processing Plants. The owner or operator of a non-metallic mineral processing plant shall not operate the plant unless it is equipped with a fugitive emission control system that is operated and maintained to control the emission of particulate matter.\n\nSource. #9793, eff 10-1-10; ss by #12693, eff 12-22-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a2800.html"
